```uvlang
scene Movie_Mode {
    set light_level to 10%
}

scene Morning {
    set light_level to 100%
    conflict with Movie_Mode
}

action Smart_Oven {
    condition Home_Status == "Away"
    disable
}

action Air_Conditioner {
    condition any Window_Sensor == "Open"
    disable
    delay 5 minutes
    condition all Window_Sensor == "Closed"
    enable
}
```

Please note that `uvlang` is a fictional language for the purpose of this translation. In actual UML or State Machine modeling languages, such logic would be represented differently.